── SYNTAX ERROR ───────────────── E0100_range_loop_with_an_index.lt:3:8  [E0100]

Stilt loops with each index as `for (i, x) in xs.enumerate(0)`:

  3 │   for i, x := range xs { print("{i} {x}") }
    │        ^

A `for` takes one pattern, here a tuple of the index and the element.

To fix it, write `enumerate`:

  3 │   for (i, x) in xs.enumerate(0) { print("{i} {x}") }
    │       ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
